     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Dear all,<div><br></div><div>I have a question regarding my output as I am a bit lost on how to interpret it. I have a model with 10 observed variables. One predictor (X), two mediators (M1 and M2) and three outcomes (Y1,Y2,Y3). In addition I have 4 control variables (C1,C2,C3,C4).</div><div><br></div><div>I used to Lavaan to model the relationships in this way:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">Model1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;<br>#regressions<br>  M1 ~ X1 + C1 + C2 + C3 + C4<br>  M2 ~ X1 + C1 + C2 + C3 + C4<br>  Y1 ~ M1 + M2 + X1 + C1 + C2 + C3 + C4<br>  Y2 ~ M1 + M2 + X1 + C1 + C2 + C3 + C4<br>  Y3 ~ M1 + M2 + X1 + C1 + C2 + C3 + C4<br>#covariances<br>  X1 ~~ C1 + C2 + C3 + C4<br>  C1 ~~ C2 + C3 + C4<br>  C2 ~~ C3 + C4<br>  C3 ~~ C4<br>  M1 ~~ M2<br>&#39;</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>When I ask for output of  Model1 I get the following:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">lavaan </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">20</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> converged normally after </span><span style=\"color:#066\">144</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> iterations<br><br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Number</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> of observations                           </span><span style=\"color:#066\">243</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Estimator</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                                         ML<br>  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Minimum</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Function</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Test</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Statistic</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.000</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Degrees</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> of freedom                                 </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Minimum</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Function</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Value</span><span style=\"color:#000\">               </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0000000000000</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Model</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> test baseline model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Minimum</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Function</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Test</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Statistic</span><span style=\"color:#000\">              </span><span style=\"color:#066\">750.624</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Degrees</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> of freedom                                </span><span style=\"color:#066\">45</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  P</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">value                                        </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.000</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">User</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> model versus baseline model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Comparative</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Fit</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Index</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">CFI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                    </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.000</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Tucker</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Lewis</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Index</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TLI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                       </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.000</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Loglikelihood</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">and</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Information</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Criteria</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Loglikelihood</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> user model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">H0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">              </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"